{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\hist\\022.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Unit:01 TheAncient Civilizations", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[491, 121], [755, 117], [755, 140], [491, 143]]}, {"text": "Governance and Society in Ancient Egypt", "conf": 0.87, "box": [[115, 162], [753, 163], [753, 200], [115, 199]]}, {"text": "Egyptian society was organized like a pyramid. The pharaohs were at the top. Pharaohs", "conf": 0.952, "box": [[111, 218], [1162, 208], [1163, 248], [112, 258]]}, {"text": "were the kings and queens of Egypt. Next to him was Vizier. All the other officials reported", "conf": 0.953, "box": [[109, 252], [1162, 245], [1163, 285], [109, 292]]}, {"text": "the chief treasurer, and the minister of public works. Scribes kept track of the finances and", "conf": 0.901, "box": [[106, 320], [1162, 316], [1163, 358], [106, 362]]}, {"text": "recorded taxes and the census. The farmers who lived in small villages always paid the", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[105, 355], [1160, 353], [1161, 393], [105, 395]]}, {"text": "taxes on the crops they grew. This strata of society also provided soldiers in the military", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[105, 391], [1159, 392], [1159, 429], [105, 428]]}, {"text": "andforced laborforbuildingprojects inthekingdom.", "conf": 0.932, "box": [[107, 426], [730, 433], [730, 462], [106, 455]]}, {"text": "ab.com", "conf": 0.795, "box": [[651, 775], [945, 604], [984, 672], [691, 843]]}, {"text": "King", "conf": 0.637, "box": [[582, 788], [662, 799], [657, 838], [577, 827]]}, {"text": "Vizier", "conf": 0.851, "box": [[568, 850], [668, 850], [668, 885], [568, 885]]}, {"text": "Priests-Elite-Officials", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[451, 905], [794, 907], [794, 940], [451, 938]]}, {"text": "Physicians-Engineers", "conf": 0.882, "box": [[456, 962], [790, 964], [790, 997], [456, 994]]}, {"text": "Scribes-Merchants", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[476, 1016], [768, 1018], [768, 1051], [476, 1049]]}, {"text": "awa", "conf": 0.727, "box": [[216, 1046], [375, 954], [409, 1014], [2